    "https://warwick-careers.tal.net/vx/lang-en-GB/mobile-0/appcentre-1/brand-4/user-11595/xf-0a29ed012b2b/candidate/register": {
      "title": "Create Account",
      "description": "Create Account - University of Warwick By clicking \"I accept\" you consent to the use of cookies on our website to support technical features and anonymous statistics I accept I accept the cookie policy Opt Out I would like to opt out of cookies Read more Read more about our cookie policy Skip to content (Opens in a new window) Login Create Account HOME OPPORTUNITIES HELP CENTRE Login Create Account Create Account Already Registered If you already have an application account, use the ‘LOGIN’ link above. Your username will be the e-mail address that you first registered with. Not Registered Create a new online application account by entering your details below. Please use an e-mail address that you will have permanent access to as our main method of contact with you will be via e-mail. First Name Last Name Email Invalid email address. Confirm Email Password Confirm Password Before starting and entering your personal details, please read our Data Protection Statement that sets out the terms of use of the site. This contains details of our data collection policies and use of personal data. By choosing to submit your registration, you consent to these terms and agree to your information being held and used as described above. I agree I agree Submit Registration Login Cookies Accessibility & Cookie Policy"
