    "https://warwick-careers.tal.net/vx/lang-en-GB/mobile-0/appcentre-1/brand-4/user-11595/xf-0a29ed012b2b/candidate": {
      "title": "Welcome",
      "description": "University of Warwick Campus Application Centre - University of Warwick By clicking \"I accept\" you consent to the use of cookies on our website to support technical features and anonymous statistics I accept I accept the cookie policy Opt Out I would like to opt out of cookies Read more Read more about our cookie policy Skip to content (Opens in a new window) Login Create Account HOME OPPORTUNITIES HELP CENTRE Login Create Account Welcome Thank you for your interest in the University of Warwick. We look forward to receiving your application. Use the links in the navigation bar above to search and apply for our current opportunities. Once you’ve registered and logged in, you’ll be able to: View the status of any completed applications. Create alerts. View all communications we have sent you. Update your personal information. Visit the Help Centre if you have questions or encounter technical difficulties navigating the site. Recruitment Team University of Warwick. Cookies Accessibility & Cookie Policy"
    },
